17
00:01:22,120 --> 00:01:27,520
This stage decodes the instruction word and computes the control signals for the instruction,

18
00:01:27,520 --> 00:01:32,800
including driving the read ports of the register file.

19
00:01:32,800 --> 00:01:36,800
