20
00:01:36,800 --> 00:01:41,400
As with our single cycle implementation, ALU operates on two source registers with our

21
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:48,200
format instructions, while for I-format instructions, the second operand is driven by the sign extended

22
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:49,640
immediate.

23
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:59,640
In this implementation, the execute stage also computes the target PC for branch instructions.

24
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:03,360
