31
00:02:33,640 --> 00:02:38,320
It's all implementation specific.

32
00:02:38,320 --> 00:02:44,040
The fifth and final stage writes the instructions result to the register file, if necessary.

33
00:02:44,040 --> 00:02:48,400
The result is taken either from the ALU output or from the data memory, depending on the

34
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:53,960
